Start.
Initialize head = NULL and tail = NULL.
Display the menu of operations.
Accept the user's choice.
Perform the selected operation:
Insert: Create a new node and connect it to the last node using prev and next.
Display: Traverse from head to tail and display all records.
Search: Find the record using the student's roll number.
Delete: Find the student and adjust both previous and next links before deleting the node.
Update: Change the name and marks of the selected student.
Sort: Arrange student records by marks from highest to lowest.
Reverse Display: Traverse from tail to head.
Exit: Terminate the program.
Display the result.
If the choice is not 8, return to the menu.
Stop.
